--- !u!114 &222323444
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 222323441}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14dec9ce0902b4f45a39fd90aed84e95, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialUI: {fileID: 96261555}
  playerCC: {fileID: 96261532}
  playerTransform: {fileID: 96261533}
  steps:
  - step: 0
    gateWall: {fileID: 1028473837}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf1adf7cf4f59554d9451b4bd9b4c59c, type: 3}
    title: Move
    body: Use WASD keys to Move and reach the area
  - step: 1
    gateWall: {fileID: 251452896}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e40db233b6c4de845bcc795f2e88a4fb, type: 3}
    title: Sprint
    body: "Use LShift to Sprint. You can run faster by pressing the X key while running.
      \nUse sprint to reach the area."
  - step: 2
    gateWall: {fileID: 1474617342}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d17ac18a6144cf41bb74644c1a175f0, type: 3}
    title: Jump
    body: Press Space to jump over the obstacle.
  - step: 3
    gateWall: {fileID: 1939325778}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3140e6accc843342830ef31894fe3ec, type: 3}
    title: Crouch
    body: 'Press Ctrl to crouch to go through the obstacle.

      Smaller, harder
      to see.'
  - step: 4
    gateWall: {fileID: 129913027}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ead7f5080e7516a48888fa4fb0e6af32, type: 3}
    title: Prone
    body: 'Press Z to go prone.

      Lowest profile. Slowest movement.'
  - step: 5
    gateWall: {fileID: 638974738}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1caa7286a7822a7459493526a00de1c4, type: 3}
    title: Shooting Range
    body: 
  - step: 6
    gateWall: {fileID: 1795304307}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 686c88be477545a4886b4700c6ac201d, type: 3}
    title: Shoot & ADS
    body: 'LMouse to shoot and Aim to RMouse.

      Press 1~3 can change weapon.

      LShift
      + T can check your remaining ammo and types of bullet.'
  - step: 7
    gateWall: {fileID: 1460417713}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7dbcba2c72206374789f5347434ef8e0, type: 3}
    title: Penetration-Wall
    body: Every bullet has its own penetration. It means it can penetrate any object
      if it has enough penetration. So if it comes to cover up, hide in a thick enough
      wall!
  - step: 8
    gateWall: {fileID: 1230012328}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e306e3f9ef25e048807b4d68708be5d, type: 3}
    title: Ricochet
    body: It occurs under various conditions such as the shape of the bullet and
      the angle of incidence
  - step: 9
    gateWall: {fileID: 1083684516}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f789b86d96970d84fbcf777b991dd5af, type: 3}
    title: Body Health System
    body: 'Your body is divided into: Head, Thorax, Stomach, Arms, and Legs.

      If
      your Head or Thorax health reaches 0, or your overall health drops to 0, you
      die.

      Press Tab key to check your health!'
  - step: 10
    gateWall: {fileID: 1413954329}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef548590cb6dce14db469b6a10ef743b, type: 3}
    title: IFAK- LightBleeding/Heal
    body: 'Use 4 keys to handle Light Bleeding.

      You can press TAB keys and
      drag item to heal parts  you want'
  - step: 11
    gateWall: {fileID: 1745606693}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b6d0c79ddad292546bcec5bd4a919112, type: 3}
    title: Tourniquet- Heavy Bleeding
    body: 'Use 5 keys to handle Heavy Bleeding.

      You can press TAB keys and
      drag item to handle parts you want'
  - step: 12
    gateWall: {fileID: 1692246800}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f5538e677a0e21b4aa2905c30c39f2cc, type: 3}
    title: Splint - Fracture
    body: 'Use 6 keys to handle fracture.

      You can press TAB keys and drag
      item to handle parts you want'
  - step: 13
    gateWall: {fileID: 0}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b3b6e2eb1743f1b42b30c875313613dc, type: 3}
    title: Surgery Kit - Blackout
    body: 'Use 7 keys to handle blackout.

      You can press TAB keys and drag
      item to handle parts you want.

      But you can''t handle Head and Thorax!'
  - step: 14
    gateWall: {fileID: 0}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d8680ec818441c24998f3b3c26637b75, type: 3}
    title: Extract!
    body: Survive and Extract!
  - step: 15
    gateWall: {fileID: 0}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c255a5dd5871f3e4fa30820674279bf5, type: 3}
    title: Extraction Success
    body: Good job!
  - step: 16
    gateWall: {fileID: 0}
    tutorialAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c255a5dd5871f3e4fa30820674279bf5, type: 3}
    title: 
    body: 
  healthManager: {fileID: 96261552}
  extractRoom: {fileID: 526517225}
  dummy1: {fileID: 272118685}
  dummy2: {fileID: 139214887}
